Notes
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party source code or redistributable assets are embedded in this
repository. The only third-party asset present in the working tree
(test/admin/assets/fonts/NanumGothic.ttf) lives under a git-ignored, local-only
test fixture and is neither tracked nor distributed with this project.

"huma" here (github.com/park-jun-woo/huma, a test-generation CLI) is unrelated
to github.com/danielgtaylor/huma (a Go API framework). No code is borrowed from
that project.
